{"id":"n70378-7-8","stage":1,"title":"잡다 · 叫","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n70378-7-8-1","ko":"두 시까지 늦지 말고 와.","zh":"别晚于两点过来。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"두","meaning":"两","explanation":"두：两","readings":[{"term":"두","audio":"/audio/dfedd225bb659d500f65.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71458","senseId":"1","lemma":"두","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"두","audio":"/audio/dfedd225bb659d500f65.mp3"}},{"text":"시까지","meaning":"点，点钟","explanation":"시：点，点钟；까지：表示终点或范围：“到、直到、连……都”。","readings":[{"term":"시","audio":"/audio/bfa42cf6a12e91233038.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65108","senseId":"1","lemma":"시","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"시까지","audio":"/audio/972d301887c6b402fd38.mp3"}},{"text":"늦지","meaning":"晚，迟到","explanation":"늦다：晚，迟到；지：连接后续表达，可形成对照；与 않다、못하다、말다 等合用时表示否定、不能或禁止。","readings":[{"term":"늦다","audio":"/audio/8678e3dcf30b4fad0aa5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61181","senseId":"1","lemma":"늦다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"늦지","audio":"/audio/c015602a793539936328.mp3"}},{"text":"말고","meaning":"不要做、停止做（-지 말다）","explanation":"말다：不要做、停止做（-지 말다）；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"말다","audio":"/audio/f8b54c8d9bfb2043a3b8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72580","senseId":"1","lemma":"말다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"말고","audio":"/audio/1473c8e39b00e08bbd22.mp3"}},{"text":"와.","meaning":"来","explanation":"오다：来；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"오다","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69514","senseId":"23","lemma":"오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"와","audio":"/audio/d536e6255a4151eae226.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"dfedd225bb659d50","term":"두","zh":"两","audio":"/audio/dfedd225bb659d500f65.mp3","entryId":"71458","definition":"两个的。","pronunciation":["두ː"]},{"id":"bfa42cf6